msgctxt "web"
msgid "Send a game"
msgstr "Skicka ett spel"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:53
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Välj ett spels mapp: den hamnar i PC5:s INSTALL-mapp och sedan frågar PC5 "
"om det ska installeras."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:55
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose a folder"
msgstr "Välj en mapp"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:57
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"A phone that can't choose a folder: type the game's folder name, then "
"choose its files."
msgstr ""
"En telefon som inte kan välja en mapp: skriv spelets mappnamn och välj "
"sedan dess filer."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:60
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose files"
msgstr "Välj filer"

